# Reference screenshots of other systems: notes, not part of the app, and
# megabytes the repository does not need to carry.
#
# The leading slash matters. Written as `Masters/` this also matched
# src/pages/masters/ -- git matches a bare directory name at any depth, and on
# Windows it is not case-sensitive -- so three screens the app imports were
# silently never committed and the build failed on a clean checkout. Anchored
# to the root, it excludes only the folders meant here.
/Masters/
/Janki Erp/

# Data backups. These hold real customer, order and staff records, and this
# repository is public — a backup committed once stays in the history.
backup-*.json
